+
+Files changed:
+- mm/src/overlays/actors/ovl_player_actor/z_player.c
+- mm/src/overlays/fbdemos/ovl_fbdemo_wipe5/z_fbdemo_wipe5.c
+
+Player: 35 resource-name operands in 17 conditional expressions (18 reported MSVC C4048 diagnostics including nested expressions plus one related GCC finding) now explicitly use PlayerAnimationHeader* handles. The addresses and selected assets remain the same. PlayerAnimation_Change already recognizes __OTR__ resource handles and resolves them before dereferencing the animation header. No animation branches, timing, or resource names changed.
+
+Wipe5: Both segmented framebuffer-address arguments now explicitly convert through uintptr_t to void*. The encoded address remains 0x0F000001 and the source/destination order remains unchanged.
+
